{title: Anjaam}
{artist: Gajendra Verma}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C]Aankhon mein ashq hi sahi... [Am],        [C]Dil mein mohabbat hi sahi... [Am]
[C]Jaisi apni, uski haalat hi sahi... [Am],        Par yeh [F]tay hai ki wo
[G]Qayamat mujhpe dhayegi,        [F]Haan wo jayegi wo [G]jaayegi
Haan woh [C]jaayegi,        Haan woh [Am]jaayegi... [F] ...woh... [G]
[C]Baato baato me ye baat ki kya hona hai [Am]
[C]Fir wo samzana jo manzur-e-khuda hona hai [Am]
Oh badi [C]berukhi se kehna ki juda hona hai [Am]
Aur toh [F]har chuke bas [G]ek sitam baaqi hai
Wo [F]juda hi hai bas [G]jane ki rasam baki [C]hai
Rasam baaki [Am]hai...rasam baaki [F]hai,        Rasam baaki [G]hai...woh o [C]wo..
[C]Usne is [Am]pyar ka [F]anjam soch [G]rakha hai
[C]Usne is [Am]pyar ka [F]anjam soch [G]rakha hai,        [C] ... [Am]
[C]Chand bhi aa gaya chhat pe, sitare bhi [Am]
[C]Mehndi bhi rach gayi gulab bhi hajare bhi [Am]
[C]Kaun dekhe kisi seene mein angaare bhi [Am]
Dil e [F]barbaad mein [G]shola aur chingari hai
[F]Mujhe pata hai kis [G]jashan ki tayari [C]hai
[C]Usne is [Am]pyar ka [F]anjam soch [G]rakha hai
[C]Usne is [Am]pyar ka [F]anjam soch [G]rakha hai
Par yeh [F]tay hai ki wo qayamat mujhpe dhayegi
[G]Haan wo jayegi wo jaayegi haan woh [C]jaayegi
